Market Challenges
Implementation hurdles include:

High capex requirements: Average system deployment costs $2–5 million per tolling point
Data security concerns: 37% of transport authorities cite cybersecurity as top risk
Interoperability gaps: Only 14% of global systems can process foreign vehicle tags

